# EVONIX Baseband-Guard fragment (optional, dispatch only)
# Applied on top of evonix.config when the workflow runs with use_bbg=true.
# Wiring (security/baseband-guard symlink + Makefile + Kconfig + CONFIG_LSM)
# mirrors upstream vc-teahouse/Baseband-guard setup.sh (cloud-compile path).
# BLOCK_BOOT/BLOCK_RECOVERY stay OFF so kernels/recovery remain flashable
# from the running system; the allowlist is the upstream-generic list until
# a rodin-specific allowlist is validated on-device (see workflow WARNING).
CONFIG_BBG=y
# CONFIG_BBG_BLOCK_BOOT is not set
# CONFIG_BBG_BLOCK_RECOVERY is not set
